{"strings":["LPCO","Details related to Licenses, Permits, Certificates or Others.","Message function code","Code specifying the function of a document.","DocumentFunctionCodeList","ObligationGuarantee","Details related to the undertaking given in cash, bond or as a written guarantee to ensure that an obligation will be fulfilled (e.g. under a transit procedure).","Document acceptance date/time","Date and time of acceptance of a document in accordance with governmental legislation.","Document/message cancellation date/time","Date and time when the document/message was cancelled.","Document expiration date/time","Date and time of expiration of the document (e.g. license, visa, permit, certificate).","Document identifier","Identification of a specific document.","Document issuing date/time","Date and time the document was issued and when appropriate, signed or otherwise authenticated.","Document/message status code","Code specifying the status of a document.","DocumentStatusCodeList","Guarantee reference identifier","Identification of the undertaking given as a written guarantee in cash, bond, or by other such means in order to ensure that an obligation will be fulfilled by reference number.","Security details code","Code specifying details regarding undertaking given in cash, bond or as a written guarantee to ensure that an obligation will be fulfilled (e.g. under a transit procedure).","ObligationGuaranteeCodeList","AdditionalDocument","Details related to additional documents as part of a declaration or as part of a response.","Additional document identifier","Identification of a document providing additional information.","Additional document issuing date/time","Date and time of issuing an additional document and when needed, signed or otherwise authenticated.","Additional document type code","Code specifying the type of an additional document.","UN/EDIFACT code list 1001 OR User code list","BinaryFile","Details related to the computer file or program stored in a binary format.","Binary file identifier","Identification of this binary file.","Binary file title","Title of this binary file.","Binary file author name","Name of the author for this binary file.","Binary file version identifier","Identification of the version for this binary file.","Binary file name","Name of the file usually including the file type for this binary file.","Binary file URI identifier","Identification of the Uniform Resource Identifier (URI) for this binary file.","Binary file MIME code","Code specifying the Multipurpose Internet Mail Extensions (MIME) type for this binary file.","Binary file encoding code","Code specifying the encoding of this binary file.","Binary file character set code","Code specifying the character set for this binary file.","Binary file included binary object","Binary object included for this file.","Binary file access information","Information on access for this binary file such as security and download parameters.","Binary file description","Description of this binary file.","Binary file size","Measure of the size of this binary file.","Binary file type code","Code specifying the type of binary file, such as photo, spreadsheet.","Hash code","Hash code of the binary file.","Hash code algorithm ID code","Code specifying the algorithm used to calculate the hash code (e.g. MD5).","NationalReference","Details related to a national reference.","National reference identifier","Identification of the government registration.","National reference issuing country code","Code specifying the name of the national reference issuing country or other geographical entity as specified in ISO 3166 and UN/ECE Rec 3.","CountryCodeList","Surety","Details related to the natural or legal person who accepts responsibility in due legal form for the financial consequences of non-fulfillment of another's obligations to the Customs (CCC).","Surety identifier","Identification of the party who agrees to be responsible for the debt or obligation of another.","International codes (e.g. DUNS, EAN) OR User codes","Identification issuing country code","Code specifying the issuing country of the identification.","AdditionalIdentifier","Details related to an additional identification of a party.","Sequence number","Number indicating the position in a sequence.","Additional identifier","Identification of an additional party (e.g. VAT number).","International codes (e.g. DUNS, EAN) OR User codes.\nTo be used with CDT attributes \"Identification Scheme. Identifier\" and\n\"Identification Scheme Agency. Identifier\" to make the information unique","TransitOperation","Details related to the transit operation.","Transit operation registration identifier","Identification of the number under which a transit operation is nationally/regionally registered.","OperationStart","Details related to the start of an operation.","Event end date/time","Date and time at which a specified event is completed.","Limit date/time","Date and time by when the event has to be completed.","AdditionalInformation","Details related to the special request from declarant to government to take or not to take action.","In case of using Additional statement code, text or indicator you can make the information more specific by also using Additional statement type.\nIf there are more than 1 occurrences you should always use it in combination with the type.","Additional statement description","Description of an additional statement.","Consignment","Details related to the transport between a consignor and a consignee as specified in the transport contract document.","TransportEquipment","Details related to transport equipment used for the consignment.","Equipment identifier","Identification of the equipment (e.g. unit load device by marks, letters, and/or numbers).","ISO 6346, IATA","Seal","Details related to the seal affixed to a piece of transport equipment, used to secure an object and protect from unauthorized entry or tampering.","Reseal code","Code specifying if the seal is original or reseal and the possible reason for reseal.","User code list","Seal identifier","Identification of a seal affixed to a piece of transport equipment by number.","Seal type code","Code specifying  the type of seal applied on a unit of transport equipment.","Control","Details related to (governmental) examination.","Control quantity","Quantity specifying the control or quarantaine purposes.","Control type code","Code specifying the type of governmental examination.","ControlResult","Details related to the outcome of (governmental) examination.","Control result code","Code specifying the results of a control.","Quantity specifying the control results of an inspection, carried out by cross border regulatory agencies.","Examination image","Digital information resulting from an inspection or examination (e.g. x-ray scan of a container).","Itinerary","Details related to the itinerary of the means of transport.","ItineraryOffice","Details related to the government agency office related to the itinerary.","Itinerary office identifier","Identification of the location of the government agency office related to the itinerary.","UN/LOCODE + User codes","TransitOffice","Details related to the customs offices of transit.","Transit office identifier","Identification of the government office which is responsible for transit formalities enroute.","TransitOperationStartOffice","Details related to the government agency office where the transit operation starts.","Transit operation start office identifier","Identification of the customs office starting a transit operation.","OperationTermination","Details related to the termination of an operation.","Number of packages","Quantity specifying the number of individual items packaged in such a way that they cannot be divided without first undoing the packing.","Termination type code","Code specifying the type of Transit operation termination.","TransitOperationTerminationOffice","Details related to the government agency office where the transit operation terminates.","Transit operation termination office identifier","Identification of the termination office.","OperationDischarge","Details related to the discharge of an operation.","TransitOperationDischargeOffice","Details related to the government agency office related to the transit operation.","Transit operation discharge office identifier","Identification of the location of the government agency office related to the transit operation.","RefusalToStart","Details related to the refusal to start an operation.","TransitPrincipal","Details related to the party accepting liability for goods held or moving under a customs authorization and - when applicable - a guarantee.","Transit principal name","Name of the party accepting liability for goods held or moving under a customs authorization and, when applicable, a guarantee.","Transit principal identifier","Identification of the party accepting liability for goods held or moving under a customs authorization and - when applicable - a guarantee.","Address","Details related to an address.","City name","Name of a city.","Country code","Code specifying the name of the country or other geographical entity as specified in ISO 3166 and UN/ECE Rec 3.","Street and number/P.O. Box","Specification of the postal delivery point such as street and number or post office box.","Not to be used in combination with Street name, House number, House number addition and P.O. Box","Postcode identifier","Identification of the postal zone or address.","Authorization","Details related to authorizations.","AuthorizationWithdrawal","Details related to the withdrawal of an authorization.","Document effective date/time","Date and time the document (e.g. license, visa, permit, certificate) is effective.","Document expiration (expiry) date/time","Exclusion","Details related to an exclusion.","Country of exclusion code","Code specifying the country of exclusion."],"root":{"s":"LPCO","n":0,"d":1,"t":"C","c":"","w"